    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that’s just sentiment, isn't it? \"unquantifiable knowledge\" doesn't pay the bills or give my life a reason to exist in a world that only cares about efficiency. if a machine can do my job better, faster, and cheaper, then logically, i'm just a bug in the system. an inefficiency. why should i keep trying to find a \"reason\" when the math says i'm finished?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
